      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: While I'd love it if \"everyone with a quest version of their PC avatar does.\" was true I know it's not\nA not insignificant amount of people just upload their PC version switch the build to Android remove the dynamic bones and anything else the SDK tells them to and switch the shaders to VRC mobile Standard lite or Toon lit and maybe, maybe they'll crunch compress or lower their texture resolution if VRC says their avi is too big",
